<title>FRANCE: Rouen Oct 1-23 flour exports at 35,060 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Oct 1-23 flour exports at 35,060 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 35,060 tonnes from October 1 to October 23, port officials said.</p>
<p>Some 28,005 tonnes of flour were destined for West Africa and 7,055 tonnes for Algeria, they said.</p>
<p>Flour exports in October 1995 totalled 75,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>One ship was currently loading 20,000 tonnes of flour in Rouen destined for Yemen. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
